# Source and the generated pages are text and go into the repository with LF
# line endings whatever machine committed them - a Windows checkout must not
# turn the built HTML into a whole-file diff. Office files and images are
# bytes: no conversion, no textual diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.docx binary
*.doc  binary
*.xls  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.zip  binary
